  "body": "## Goal\n\nPost a prismatic punch with a reentrant boundary on the native Agie post. The convex post refuses this shape because its complete-solid check relies on outward support planes.\n\n## Work\n\nProve that the complete modeled workpiece is a vertical extrusion with the selected nominal outline. Check the swept entry, the wire envelope, stock clearance, and separation clearance. Preserve the existing refusal for additional workpieces, hidden cavities, extra material across the approach, and channels too narrow for the verified controller passes.\n\nDone means: A synthetic reentrant punch that fits the process passes the normal post and the offline control. The tests refuse a narrow slot, a lead that crosses retained material, a hidden cavity, and any profile whose compensation cannot be checked.\n",
